<h3 style="font-size: 20px;">What is a Sweeper?</h3>
<p style="font-size: 16px;">A sweeper machine, also known as a street sweeper or road sweeper, is a specialized vehicle designed for cleaning and maintaining streets, parking lots, and other paved surfaces. These machines are equipped with rotating brushes or brooms that sweep debris, dirt, litter, and other unwanted materials from the surface into a collection bin or hopper.</p>
<p>Sweeper machines come in various configurations, including compact models for paths and narrow areas, and larger, truck-mounted versions for streets and parking lots. These machines play a crucial role in maintaining urban cleanliness, preventing the accumulation of debris, leaves, and litter, which not only enhances the visual appeal of public spaces but also contributes to environmental hygiene and safety.</p>
