<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-3" style="text-align: center;">
<div class="thumbnail">
<img style="width: 100%;" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0948/6378/6359/files/migrated-96.png?v=1775586367" alt="Maintenance Requirements">
<div class="caption">
<h3 style="text-align: center;"><strong>Maintenance Requirements</strong></h3>
<p>Assess the maintenance needs of the sweeper, including ease of access for cleaning, routine maintenance, and any potential downtime. At Clenli Direct, our Service Team can provide maintenance assistance as required to minimize operational disruptions.</p>
</div>
