<div class="caption">
<h3 style="text-align: center;"><strong>Budget Considerations</strong></h3>
<p>Establish a budget for your sweeper investment, considering not only the initial purchase price but also ongoing maintenance costs and any additional accessories required for your specific needs.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
