<h3 style="text-align: center;"><strong>Comfort &amp; Safety</strong></h3>
<p style="text-align: center;">Prioritize the well-being of operators by choosing sweepers with ergonomic designs, comfortable seating, and safety features such as good visibility, emergency braking systems, and operator training options. At Clenli Direct, we provide free certified training on all sweepers purchased!</p>
